Proceeding analysis with
	Input fasta:             assembly/output/verkko_unphased/TUE_02_02UL/assembly.fasta
	Reference fasta:         data/ref/T2T-CHM13.v2.fasta
	Telomere motif:          TTAGGG


Extracting sequence information

seqkit fx2tab -j 6 -o assembly/qc/unphased_verkko/TUE_02_02UL/T2T_contigs.unphased.seqinfo.txt assembly/output/verkko_unphased/TUE_02_02UL/assembly.fasta


Extracting 1000bps from start and end of sequences for telomere motif identification

seqkit subseq -w 0 -j 6 -r 1:1000/-1000:-1 assembly/output/verkko_unphased/TUE_02_02UL/assembly.fasta >assembly/qc/unphased_verkko/TUE_02_02UL/T2T_contigs.unphased.teloinput.fa


searching telomere motif

tidk search -d . -f assembly/qc/unphased_verkko/TUE_02_02UL/T2T_contigs.unphased.teloinput.fa -o assembly/qc/unphased_verkko/TUE_02_02UL/T2T_contigs.unphased -s TTAGGG -w 1000


